==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Pawmot|76}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pawmot}}.
*'''Thunder Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Delta Species|Jolteon ex|109}} from the {{TCG|EX Delta Species}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

